{'symbol': 'O', 'date': '2023-04-11 16:05:00', 'title': '634TH CONSECUTIVE COMMON STOCK MONTHLY DIVIDEND DECLARED BY REALTY INCOME', 'text': 'SAN DIEGO , APRIL 11, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0REALTY INCOME CORPORATION (REALTY INCOME, NYSE: O), THE MONTHLY DIVIDEND COMPANY®, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS DECLARED THE 634TH CONSECUTIVE COMMON STOCK MONTHLY DIVIDEND. THE DIVIDEND AMOUNT OF $0.2550 PER SHARE, REPRESENTING AN ANNUALIZED AMOUNT OF $3.060 PER SHARE, IS PAYABLE ON MAY 15, 2023 TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF MAY 1, 2023.'}